{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a05fc9222e40ce82969669b29a3207a3a5756542565a6d80202b92fbf413e1ea", "ja": "（明日はいよいよ、大型プールでのイベント公演。\nリハーサルも無事終わったし、問題なさそうだな！）", "zh": "（明天就是在大型泳池的活动公演了。\n排练也顺利结束，看来没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "41fbe856f125d605420d84586861ca4399d7037963fd23c43a4dbfc99bb22b15", "ja": "わあ～！　すっごくいい波！\n絶好のサーフィン日和って感じだね☆", "zh": "哇～！好棒的海浪！\n感觉是很适合冲浪的好天气呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "2790c98f1bdc7044e6ca6d90d90c628289a30a601b49fefae8f546be9113f7cf", "ja": "{$P$}！\n私、明日のイベントすっごく楽しみだよーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我超期待明天活动的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8af4032dc5462ebe70c109ad55210eeddf2b4279bd250d243b27522f030e7a7", "ja": "サーフィンって難しそうに見えたんだけど、\nやってみるとそうでもなかった！　楽しいし☆", "zh": "冲浪看起来很难，但实际体验后，\n发现也不是真的那么难！而且又很好玩☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9a96a5480fd9375d07c8d7f87966d5e2ed27e299d6c374a94f751018b4ddb23c", "ja": "はは、そうか。海美は運動が得意だし、\nスポーツなら何でもできるんだな。すごいぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。毕竟海美擅长运动，\n什么运动都难不倒你呢，很厉害喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "e2895b4193fe83495f57f0cb8bd21018e82a700f7a8dacaa4402cab34569aa7e", "ja": "や、やだな、{$P$}。何でもなんて、\nそんなコトないと思うけど～。えへ、えへへ……♪", "zh": "讨、讨厌啦，{$P$}。\n我没有你说的那么厉害啦，嘿、嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "ec81755f760f0983ef097841831c33af6b32d39801b3bdb995e9852f02046a32", "ja": "あ、そうだっ！　あのね{$P$}、\nお願いがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，对了！那个，{$P$}，\n我有件事想拜托你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f54aab7e01b70097898c5eb0b0f3c5af5eee10399719854d9b6ae2eacb755650", "ja": "私、明日サーフィンする時に、\nチューブライドっていうの、やってみたいっ！", "zh": "明天冲浪时，\n我想试试看所谓的「波管驾乘」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1008_p", "source_sha256": "df5d2ccbed5a59648ae4f06d23001a2419d4df9043a14341d294fb088c9ea20d", "ja": "チューブライド……確か、サーフィンの？", "zh": "波管驾乘……我记得是冲浪的技巧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e52834ddff3621ddda22213a9f0de299ad365be8ad8dfdd3c71cc57bea44e4d", "ja": "そう！　輪になった波の中を、くぐる技！\n本番でばっちり決めたら、絶対盛り上がるよね！？", "zh": "没错！是在海浪卷起的管状空间里冲浪！\n如果正式上场时能完美做出来，现场一定会很嗨吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e0bb4f14b557a7bc2ee77f672c90af30a5b552ee94b2a0366eab90758d090819", "ja": "そうだな。でもサーフィンの技って、\n難易度が高いって聞いた事があるけど……。", "zh": "是啊，不过我听说，\n冲浪的技巧难度很高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "725fae371c05635c1cfa708a37d0c96f4eeaa9ada24613843001b73cc2c2ae19", "ja": "大丈夫！　美咲ちゃんに教えてもらって、\nちゃんと練習したから！　だから、ねっ？", "zh": "放心！我有请美咲教我并充分练习过了！\n所以，能让我试试看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d111906889761f0d406bea7b0ec804c88b273a5ead9e89e9974cd35d66e910a5", "ja": "青羽さんが……そうだったのか。\n後でお礼を言わないと。", "zh": "青羽小姐她……原来是这样，\n之后得跟她道谢才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ae9f2c2c5a5eedb4d6bb6a0b760df19846077172cbb506ca5f827fab0ee841c3", "ja": "でも難易度が高いって事は、\nけっこう危ないんじゃ……。", "zh": "可是难度很高的话，\n不就代表相当危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "ec90857ab611b44223ef873533e7fab07d9d66e0f20a46911f7ccf2b3657436f", "ja": "えっ、それって心配ってこと？　スポーツで\n心配されるなんて、なんか新鮮だな～♪", "zh": "咦，你是在担心我吗？\n因为运动的事被担心，总觉得好新鲜喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "cedc2532967af96d7a0e50350a513ef02034e5e46b955dfe5c17da71b1dbff3e", "ja": "でも、大丈夫！　約束する！　無理はしないから！\nだからお願い、ねっ？", "zh": "不过，你放心！我答应你不会勉强自己的！\n所以拜托让我试试，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0384b45a8933a20645534ba72c4d1c7f865161e3fbd0d5604c4cd0d917a2ca48", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ、最終的な判断は海美に任せるよ。\nその代わり、絶対に無理しない事。いいな？", "zh": "这样啊，那最终判断就交给海美了。\n但你绝对不能勉强自己，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb921e448e077b47a628357315ea0d07a4d69c96192a10e8f51ce1706ad86459", "ja": "うん！　ありがとう、{$P$}！\nえへへ、うれしいな～♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，好开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "aaf94697d123519ccc5ebafbef5c37a639e1c176907637a2c5ed5215013b5969", "ja": "あっ！　せっかくだし、チューブライドが成功したら、\nロデオフリップにもチャレンジしてみようかな……？", "zh": "啊！机会难得，如果波管驾乘成功的话，\n也来挑战一下540度空中大翻转好了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b3f87ed4c91037ec1c10a5432d1e7f620a3ac01158c31c1d488f16833bfdbbb7", "ja": "こらこら……言ったそばから。\n無理はしないって約束だぞ、海美。", "zh": "喂喂喂……才刚说完而已。\n你答应过我不会勉强自己喔，海美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e2a8cc8d90842e4fbe1d39780177e9724dbbf50755833597fd1b9cb9b80c68d", "ja": "うん！　あ、じゃあ\n{$P$}も約束してくれる？", "zh": "嗯！啊，\n那{$P$}也可以答应我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0143_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "e9b33db9e2bd45bd818566e26805229449f67115f6f2e3d7d8d9f1e6a15a04f8", "ja": "チューブライド、絶対に成功させるから！\nだから、私から目を離さないでねーっ☆", "zh": "我一定会成功做出波管驾乘的！\n所以，你的目光不要离开我喔～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
